<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>Item&#8201;3.02. Unregistered Sales of Equity Securities.</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Simultaneously with the closing
of the IPO, pursuant to the Private Placement Units Purchase Agreement, the Company completed the private sale of an aggregate of 350,000
units (the &#8220;<span style="text-decoration: underline">Private Placement Units</span>&#8221;) to the Sponsor at a purchase price of $10.00 per Private Placement Unit, generating
gross proceeds to the Company of $3,500,000. The Private Placement Units (and underlying securities) are identical to the Units sold in
the IPO, except as otherwise disclosed in the Registration Statement. No underwriting discounts or commissions were paid with respect
to such sale. The issuance of the Private Placement Units was made pursuant to the exemption from registration contained in Section 4(a)(2)
of the Securities Act of 1933, as amended.</p>

